      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Purpose\nExtracts table + column metadata from source\ndatabases. Discovers FK relationships, infers\nschema structure, writes to Neo4j catalog.\nAnatomy\nNeo4j I/O\ndata-discovery \u00b7 data-discovery-mysql \u00b7 DCAT-2 export",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Purpose\nExtracts table + column metadata from source\ndatabases. Discovers FK relationships, infers\nschema structure, writes to Neo4j catalog.\nAnatomy\nNeo4j I/O\ndata-discovery \u00b7 data-discovery-mysql \u00b7 DCAT-2 export",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
