      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Purpose\nTranslates approved ODCS specs into the dprod\ngraph. AI-assisted column mapping (source \u2192 target).\nGenerates virtual SQL views with FK inference.\nAnatomy\nNeo4j I/O\ndata-mapping-neo4j \u00b7 data-serving-virtual-view \u00b7 odcs-to-graph \u00b7 data-product-spec-to-dprod-neo4j",
