      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Neo4j Knowledge Graph  \u00b7  System of Record\nDiscovery \u2192 Profiling \u2192 Enrichment \u2192 Products \u2192 Concepts\nLight Domain Ontology \u00b7 PROV-O provenance \u00b7 Explainability & traceability\nSHACL \u00b7 PROV-O \u00b7 DCAT-2 \u00b7 W3C \u00b7 Custom product graph ontologies\nContext graph \u2014 understands all artifacts and their interdependencies",
